# agent scratch worktrees
#
# CLAUDE.md asks every session to run the domain bots in .claude/agents/, and an
# isolated one checks the repository out again under here. They are working
# copies, not source: transient, sometimes several gigabytes, and auto-removed.
# .claude/agents/*.md stays tracked — it is the bots themselves — so this
# ignores the worktrees directory alone rather than .claude.
.claude/worktrees/
